                <pb facs="0445" n="349" sameAs="frus:frus1931-41v01/pg349"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/9432: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-17T15:00:00-04:00">August 17, 1937—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>150. Your 272, August 16, 6 p.m. I heartily approve your action and excellent
                    note. If not already done, please inform your British and, in your discretion,
                    French colleague.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
